#: admin/setting-pages/templates/ajax-request-settings.php:20
msgid ""
"Enabled by default. Disabling signatures reduces protection for public "
"filter requests and should only be used for compatibility troubleshooting. "
"Purge page and CDN caches after enabling signatures again."
